"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:11:00.7366667"},{"Id":"TTN1","Name":"Tram T. Nguyen","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TTN1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T12:06:43.8266667"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-04-04T11:02:18.4266667"},{"Id":"JJO1","Name":"James J. O'Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JJO1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T15:06:49.6233333"},{"Id":"SCO1","Name":"Steven Owens","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SCO1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T07:24:09.2533333"},{"Id":"ERP1","Name":"Edward R. Philips","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/ERP1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-15T14:18:35.67"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T20:13:30.9433333"},{"Id":"J_S2","Name":"Jon Santiago","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/J_S2","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T14:16:07.26"},{"Id":"DAS1","Name":"Danillo A. Sena","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DAS1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-18T13:42:31.1233333"},{"Id":"TMS1","Name":"Thomas M. Stanley","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TMS1","ResponseDate":"2023-09-22T11:43:46.4"},{"Id":"C_T1","Name":"Chynah Tyler","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_T1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-17T11:50:18.5266667"},{"Id":"E_U1","Name":"Erika Uyterhoeven","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_U1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-03T07:10:10.58"},{"Id":"DTV1","Name":"David T. Vieira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DTV1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-29T17:13:07.17"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"D_B1","Name":"David Biele","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_B1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:12:22.953"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3248/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Rogers of Cambridge and Biele of Boston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3248) of David M. Rogers, David Biele and others relative to Native American heritage.  Tourism, Arts and Cultural Development.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. As used in this section, the following words shall, unless the context otherwise requires, have the following meanings:–\r\n\t\"Native American\" as defined in the Native American Graves Protection and Repatriation Act in accordance with 25 U.S.C. 3001 et seq.\r\n\t\"funerary objects\" as defined in the Native American Graves Protection and Repatriation Act in accordance with 25 U.S.C. 3001 et seq.\r\n\t\"sacred objects\" as defined in the Native American Graves Protection and Repatriation Act in accordance with 25 U.S.C. 3001 et seq.\r\n\t\"objects of cultural patrimony\" as defined in the Native American Graves Protection and Repatriation Act in accordance with 25 U.S.C. 3001 et seq.\r\n\tSECTION 2. The penalties and requirements of the Native American Graves Protection and Repatriation Act in accordance with 25 U.S.C. 3001 et seq. shall be enforced if an agency, organization, entity, or department receiving funds of any kind from the Commonwealth or any local government therein; or a trust, unincorporated association, nonprofit corporation organized under Chapter 180 of the Massachusetts General laws or public charity duly registered with the Office of the Attorney General moves to deacquisition any Native American funerary objects, human remains, sacred objects, or objects of cultural patrimony.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J30","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J30"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}